 ### Election
-- Each member's election timeout is chosen at random from a fixed range, anew each time it is reset. A follower's timer is reset when it receives an extend request from the current coordinator or grants a ballot. A follower or candidate whose timer expires becomes a **candidate**: it increments `epoch`, sets `votedFor` to itself, and sends a **ballot request** to every member of its own configuration, carrying the index and epoch of its last journal entry.
