-- A coordinator sends each other member of its configuration an **extend request**: the index and epoch of the entry immediately before the entries it sends (`prevIndex`, `prevEpoch`), zero or more entries, and the coordinator's `commitIndex`. With no entries it serves as a heartbeat.
